cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this reverse-engineering study, please cite it as below."
title: "TypingMaster 12.0.1.981 — Reverse-Engineering Analysis"
abstract: >-
  A documented reverse-engineering study of TypingMaster 12.0.1.981, a 32-bit
  Windows / Delphi VCL touch-typing tutor. The study covers the custom packer,
  a dynamically-captured decrypted image, a Ghidra decompilation of 13,137
  functions, RTTI-derived class and event-handler maps, PE resource cataloguing
  and application file formats. It contains the analysis and documentation
  only: the proprietary program, its assets, the runtime and the decompilation
  are not redistributed. Licensing logic is documented structurally only; no
  bypass is provided.
type: software
